  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0086_156a2251c952.jpg\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 77px;\" /><br /><br />The <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> has linear structure, because <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> in sp-hybridized. The weakly acidic nature of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> is due to the fact that <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> is more resonance stabilized than <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> .<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0086_e666b0de3a87.jpg\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 71px;\" />"
